# Agentic workflow

## Read order

1. Harness root `AGENTS.md` — workflow (Hermes, bridge, projects/)
2. `projects/<name>/.harness/project.manifest.json` — project config
3. `projects/<name>/AGENTS.md` — product contract (when building MVP)
4. `projects/<name>/ORCHESTRATOR.md` — current phase
5. `projects/<name>/DECISIONS.md` — architectural gates
6. `projects/<name>/.harness/tasks/` — active slices
7. `docs/kit/` — Hermes/Kiro playbooks (harness root)

## When finishing work, report

- Changed files (paths)
- Commands run + verification output
- Tests added or run
- Blockers
- Recommended next step

## Scope

- Do not edit attached plan files unless asked
- Do not push/deploy without approval
- Use `research/` only when explicitly researching; do not load huge research dumps by default
